From ueea50d33af99dbe2 at groups.google.com  Sat Dec 17 07:39:38 2011
From: ueea50d33af99dbe2 at groups.google.com (izza...@hotmail.com)
Date: Sat, 17 Dec 2011 07:39:38 +0000
Subject: Rattle installation issues on Windows 7
Message-ID: <w1rrY2ZBiUY.V-i7Zy2zuN8J@rattle-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rattle-users/c/w1rrY2ZBiUY/m/V-i7Zy2zuN8J>
